  "content": "\n\n<ul>\n<li>应大家强烈要求，我带来了这个资源包，用于搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations</a></li>\n<li>前置要求：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Minimap</a></li>\n<li>本资源包仅在收到更新请求或配合 Fresh 更新时才会进行更新</li>\n<li>支持所有版本。&nbsp;</li>\n<li>从 1.21.5 版本开始，请使用 0.2 版本。</li>\n<li>感谢大家关注本项目的发展</li>\n<li>图标项目合作：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/icon-xaeros\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Icon Xaero's</strong></a><strong>&nbsp;</strong>与 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/icon-journey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Icon Journey</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>支持作者：</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/GodKyo98\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/CzUp3Ee.png\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fgBP65uzSsM\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discord.com/api/guilds/889524360992403506/widget.png?style=banner2\"></a></p>\n<h2><strong>配套资源包：</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations-extensions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations Extensions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-skeleton-physics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Skeleton Physics</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
